OL,3,GNEWSATintwistle wildfire extinguished
OL,4,Aafter two months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildfire which burned on a moor in
OL,7,Fthe Derbyshire Peak District for two
OL,8,Fmonths has been extinguished.
OL,10,FFire crews were initially called to
OL,11,FTintwistle Moor near Glossop late on 24
OL,12,FJune. A major incident was then
OL,13,Fdeclared between 12 July and 3 August
OL,14,Fas the wildfire spread across 606
OL,15,Fhectares (1,497 acres) of woods and
OL,16,Fmoorland.
OL,18,FAt 13:00 BST on Monday, Derbyshire Fire
OL,19,Fand Rescue Service formally stood down
OL,20,Fits operation response.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
