OL,3,GNEWSATintwistle wildfire extinguished
OL,4,Aafter two months
OL,5,
OL,6,FArea manager Nathan Stevens said the
OL,7,Fstop message "marks the end of a
OL,8,Fsignificant and complex incident that
OL,9,Fhas required a sustained response".
